#: admin/views/settings.php:166
msgid ""
"Sent only when you apply or revert a fix: the rule name (e.g. ghost_sub), "
"how many subscriptions a bulk fix touched, an anonymous install id made from "
"random bytes, and the Doctor Subs, WordPress and PHP version numbers. We "
"never see your store URL, store name, customer data, or subscription details."
msgstr ""

